         view it ended in dropped a row posted in a channel and read from all-signals, where it
         does belong, and stripped rows out of a page that had already fetched them. The
         question a landing row has to answer is the one the list on screen asks, and the
         server stamped the row's channel, so the row answers it. Both arms found both. */
      /* One rule, one place: `rowShowsOnScreen` is what the reset page's merge asks too. */
      const showsOnScreen = rowShowsOnScreen;
